<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's KI sees CPI up 0.5 pct '97, 1.5 pct '98.</title>
<headline>Sweden's KI sees CPI up 0.5 pct '97, 1.5 pct '98.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Economic Research Institute KI on Wednesday said it expected consumer prices to rise 0.5 percent this year and 1.5 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>In its first quarterly forecast for the year, KI also said Swedish GDP would grow by 2.0 percent this year and by 2.5 percent in 1998.</p>
</text>
